# Business Bot test failures

If the task is diagnosing or fixing a **Business Bot** AI test failure (semantic
correctness, UX bot dims, FAIL/REVIEW on a customer reply, flaky bot judge):

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/business-bot-test-failures/SKILL.md` before
   changing `src/customerPrompt.js`, judge rubrics, `expectHint`s, or fixtures.
2. Inspect evidence and classify (A/B/C/D) first — do not assume the bot or
   judge is wrong.
3. Do not add scenario-specific production-prompt examples just to pass one test.
4. For suite run / re-run scope, also follow `.cursor/skills/e2e-fix-loop/SKILL.md`.
5. No silent judge rescue patches — see `.cursor/rules/no-judge-patches.mdc`.

Builder-only failures and bare “run e2e” requests are not this skill’s scope
unless a Business Bot check is what failed.
